The Law-keeper ({{GOD_LAW_KEEPER}}) checks every diff against this file at the
law gate. Each law has an ID, the reasoning behind it (so edge cases the law
doesn't name can be judged in its spirit), and a source date.

Format:

```
## LAW-<area>-<nnn>: <one-line rule>
**Reasoning:** <why, in the user's own words>
**Source:** interview {{FORGE_DATE}}
```

